{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"racket","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Racket","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Racket (.rkt .rktl .scrbl .rktd).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"racket","name":"Racket","extensions":[".rkt",".rktl",".scrbl",".rktd"],"grammar":"grammars/racket.json","lineComment":";","blockComment":["#|","|#"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Racket","path":"snippets/racket.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/racket.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"#\\\\|\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\|#\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \";.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^#lang\\\\s+\\\\S+\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#\\\\\\\\[A-Za-z0-9]+|'[A-Za-z0-9_\\\\-?!*]+\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[()\\\\[\\\\]]\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:define-syntax-rule|define-values|define-syntax|define-struct|with-handlers|match-define|let-values|for/vector|quasiquote|interface|for/list|for/hash|for/fold|for/sum|module\\\\+|require|provide|unquote|define|struct|lambda|letrec|begin0|unless|module|begin|match|quote|raise|class|let\\\\*|cond|case|when|set!|send|let|and|not|for|new|if|or|do)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:#false|#true|else|#t|#f)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:number->string|string-append|displayln|display|reverse|printf|format|filter|length|append|vector|foldl|foldr|apply|list|cons|hash|car|cdr|map)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/racket.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Module header\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lang\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#lang ${1:racket}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A #lang line\"\n  },\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"def\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(define (${1:name} ${2:args})\",\n      \"  $0)\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Struct\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"struct\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(struct ${1:name} (${2:fields}))\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A struct\"\n  },\n  \"Match\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"match\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(match ${1:value}\",\n      \"  [${2:pattern} $0])\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A match\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Racket\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Racket.\n\n## Files\n\n`.rkt`, `.rktl`, `.scrbl`, `.rktd`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `;`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `lang` | A #lang line |\n| `def` | A function |\n| `struct` | A struct |\n| `match` | A match |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}